<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-004" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:dream" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:dream:m0000" ref="412_2d3_654">衞玠</persName>總角時問<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:dream:m0006" ref="591_360_8ca">樂令</persName>「夢」，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:dream:m0012" ref="591_360_8ca">樂</persName>云：「是想。」<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:dream:m0020" ref="412_2d3_654">衞</persName>曰：「形神所不接，而夢豈是想邪？」<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:dream:m0038" ref="591_360_8ca">樂</persName>云：「因也。未嘗夢乘車入鼠穴，擣噉鐵杵，皆無想無因故也。」</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:illness" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:illness:m0000" ref="412_2d3_654">衞</persName>思因，經日不得，遂成病。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:illness:m0013" ref="591_360_8ca">樂</persName>聞，故命駕爲剖析之。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:illness:m0024" ref="412_2d3_654">衞</persName>即小差。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:illness:m0029" ref="591_360_8ca">樂</persName>嘆曰：「此兒胸中當必無膏肓之疾！」</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:memorial" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:memorial:m0000" ref="591_360_8ca">樂</persName>令善於淸言，而不長於手筆。將讓河南尹，請<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:memorial:m0021" ref="d2b_1d3_333">潘岳</persName>爲表。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:writing" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:writing:m0000" ref="d2b_1d3_333">潘</persName>云：「可作耳。要當得君意。」<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:writing:m0015" ref="591_360_8ca">樂</persName>爲述己所以爲讓，標位二百許語。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:writing:m0031" ref="d2b_1d3_333">潘</persName>直取錯綜，便成名筆。時人咸云：「若<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:writing:m0049" ref="591_360_8ca">樂</persName>不假<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:writing:m0052" ref="d2b_1d3_333">潘</persName>之文，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:writing:m0056" ref="d2b_1d3_333">潘</persName>不取<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-004-jin043-leguang:writing:m0059" ref="591_360_8ca">樂</persName>之旨，則無以成斯矣。」</p>
</text>
